Subject: [PATCH] spring-miuicamera: Use an adaptive launcher icon

Adapt the cupid V14.0.2.0.TLCMICM foreground assets supplied by
PixelOS-Devices/android_device_xiaomi_peridot-miuicamera patch 0006
(Arian / AdarshGrewal). Generate removals from the Spring stock APK.
Use the existing launcher resource names to preserve resource IDs.

diff --git a/res/mipmap-anydpi-v26/eto.xml b/res/mipmap-anydpi-v26/eto.xml
new file mode 100644
